---
description: Audit the actual belief updates, experiment predictions and chosen policy.
args:
  source: BankSource
  posterior: Posterior
  predictions: PredictionIndex
  policy: PolicyResult
  request: LaboratoryRequest
returns: LaboratoryCertificate
---
1. Join each surviving/rejected world back to its original joint ticket. Check that source prior mass
   was applied once and actual observation assessments explain every elimination and likelihood update.
2. Call challengeCompartment(source, posterior, predictions). Consume findings about maternal tissue,
   reciprocal orientation, readout resolution and invalid sensitivity regimes.
3. Call checkBranchStock(source.stocks, policy). Consume its actual findings about parent snapshots,
   spent original slots, isolated sibling resources and selected transition completeness.
4. Call explainResidualUncertainty(posterior, policy, request). Preserve the returned distinction
   between identified goal mechanism and genotype uncertainty in every solved reachable policy leaf.
5. Audit the root comparison against all actually valued candidate transitions. Recompute exact cost
   arithmetic from the returned branch probabilities; semantic source entailment remains in witnesses.
6. Assemble LaboratoryCertificate from these actual child findings and carried results. Include full
   source coverage, prior uncertainty and every unresolved check. Return only after these audits are bound.
